/E (Another common form of abuse is when the abuser uses a combination of threats, intimidation and endangerment to children. This includes threats to harm the children, refusal to return them to the parent, physical / sexual abuse of the children, medical / psychological neglect, and/or exposing the children to settings not appropriate to their age \(such as pornography or illicit drugs\).)
/Pg 14 0 R
